      {
        "id": 45431,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-20T16:12:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I play it, the turn order is rigid.&nbsp; So, Nightmist gets her whole turn, then Mr. Fixer gets his whole turn, then Unity gets her whole turn, and that happens every round, in that order.&nbsp;&nbsp; I put a lot of thought into optimal turn order for my heroes, though.&nbsp; For that group, I would probably be most likely to put them in the order listed above, depending on how many time-sensitive environment or ongoing cards there may be in the game.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:18:58.806Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
