        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-20T19:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mr. Fixer benefits from being before Argent Adept in turn order, as it means he can play Grease Gun out of turn and have it actually do something, or Bloody Knuckles/Harmony/a Style/a Tool on his own turn, and Overdrive on AA's turn.</p>",
